{"id":"812a4642483884b6","group":"73","path":"73/73-df-endmarked-multistack-machine.md","title":"带输入结束标记的确定性多栈机","display":"df-endmarked-multistack-machine — 带输入结束标记的确定性多栈机","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-df-endmarked-multistack-machine","aliases":["73-df-endmarked-multistack-machine"],"display":"df-endmarked-multistack-machine — 带输入结束标记的确定性多栈机","depends_on":["[[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]]","[[73-df-partial-value-conventions]]","[[73-df-finite-path-closure]]"],"source_id":"HMU2007","source_ref":"§8.5.2, print pp. 355–358; PDF pp. 377–380; local explicit normalized model","source_status":"source-statement-checked; local-formalization; proof-outline-in-note","reviewed_on":"2026-10-24","revision_round":"pdf-third-edition-20261024","edition_role":"third-edition-core","third_edition_chapter":8},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-df-endmarked-multistack-machine"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-df-endmarked-multistack-machine</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-endmarked-multistack-machine — 带输入结束标记的确定性多栈机"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0a6da8c909717780\" href=\"?note=0a6da8c909717780\" title=\"73-df-finite-words-and-languages\">73-df-finite-words-and-languages</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"773cae915e5165f3\" href=\"?note=773cae915e5165f3\" title=\"73-df-partial-value-conventions\">73-df-partial-value-conventions</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"25902d0bd75ea963\" href=\"?note=25902d0bd75ea963\" title=\"73-df-finite-path-closure\">73-df-finite-path-closure</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_id","html":"HMU2007"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"§8.5.2, print pp. 355–358; PDF pp. 377–380; local explicit normalized model"},{"key":"source_status","html":"source-statement-checked; local-formalization; proof-outline-in-note"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"third-edition-core"},{"key":"third_edition_chapter","html":"8"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\">\\(\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\">\\(k\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> 为候选八元组；结构谓词不预设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> 有效。</li>\n<li>在配置、转移和语言子句中，固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{StackMachine}_{\\Sigma,k}(M)\">\\(\\operatorname{StackMachine}_{\\Sigma,k}(M)\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,Z_0,F,\\$)\">\\(M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,Z_0,F,\\$)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\$\\notin\\Sigma\\cup\\{\\varepsilon\\}\">\\(\\$\\notin\\Sigma\\cup\\{\\varepsilon\\}\\)</span>；各分量均为该元组的投影。栈顶位于词的左端，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Z_0\">\\(Z_0\\)</span> 为保留的栈底字符。</li>\n<li>在一步关系子句中，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(q,u,\\mathbf s),(p,v,\\mathbf t)\\in\\operatorname{SConf}_{M,k}\">\\((q,u,\\mathbf s),(p,v,\\mathbf t)\\in\\operatorname{SConf}_{M,k}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j\\in\\{1,\\ldots,k\\}\">\\(j\\in\\{1,\\ldots,k\\}\\)</span> 是栈编号。语言与词的运算、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{WordLabel}\">\\(\\operatorname{WordLabel}\\)</span>、部分函数和路径闭包均采用已列依赖。</li>\n<li>栈数是结构谓词的独立参数，不由八元组隐含决定；后续配置、转移和语言均使用同一个显式参数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{StackMachine}_{\\Sigma,k}(M)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists Q,\\Gamma,q_0,Z_0,F,\\$\\;\\exists\\delta:(Q\\setminus F)\\times(\\Sigma\\cup\\{\\$,\\varepsilon\\})\\times\\Gamma^k\n\\rightharpoonup Q\\times(\\Gamma^*)^k\\;\\bigl[&amp;\nM=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,Z_0,F,\\$)\\land\\$\\notin\\Sigma\\cup\\{\\varepsilon\\}\\land0&lt;|Q|&lt;\\aleph_0\\land\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Gamma)\\land q_0\\in Q\\land Z_0\\in\\Gamma\\land F\\subseteq Q\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall q,\\mathbf X\\;((q,\\varepsilon,\\mathbf X)\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\delta)\\Longrightarrow\n\\forall a\\in\\Sigma\\cup\\{\\$\\}\\;(q,a,\\mathbf X)\\notin\\operatorname{dom}(\\delta))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall((q,a,\\mathbf X),(p,\\boldsymbol\\beta))\\in\\delta\\;\\forall j\\in\\{1,\\ldots,k\\}\\;\n[(X_j=Z_0\\Longrightarrow\\beta_j\\in(\\Gamma\\setminus\\{Z_0\\})^*\\cdot\\{\\langle Z_0\\rangle\\})\n\\land(X_j\\ne Z_0\\Longrightarrow\\beta_j\\in(\\Gamma\\setminus\\{Z_0\\})^*)]\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{StackMachine}_{\\Sigma,k}(M)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists Q,\\Gamma,q_0,Z_0,F,\\$\\;\\exists\\delta:(Q\\setminus F)\\times(\\Sigma\\cup\\{\\$,\\varepsilon\\})\\times\\Gamma^k\n\\rightharpoonup Q\\times(\\Gamma^*)^k\\;\\bigl[&amp;\nM=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,Z_0,F,\\$)\\land\\$\\notin\\Sigma\\cup\\{\\varepsilon\\}\\land0&lt;|Q|&lt;\\aleph_0\\land\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Gamma)\\land q_0\\in Q\\land Z_0\\in\\Gamma\\land F\\subseteq Q\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall q,\\mathbf X\\;((q,\\varepsilon,\\mathbf X)\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\delta)\\Longrightarrow\n\\forall a\\in\\Sigma\\cup\\{\\$\\}\\;(q,a,\\mathbf X)\\notin\\operatorname{dom}(\\delta))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall((q,a,\\mathbf X),(p,\\boldsymbol\\beta))\\in\\delta\\;\\forall j\\in\\{1,\\ldots,k\\}\\;\n[(X_j=Z_0\\Longrightarrow\\beta_j\\in(\\Gamma\\setminus\\{Z_0\\})^*\\cdot\\{\\langle Z_0\\rangle\\})\n\\land(X_j\\ne Z_0\\Longrightarrow\\beta_j\\in(\\Gamma\\setminus\\{Z_0\\})^*)]\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SConf}_{M,k}\\coloneqq Q\\times(\\Sigma\\cup\\{\\$\\})^*\\times\n\\bigl((\\Gamma\\setminus\\{Z_0\\})^*\\cdot\\{\\langle Z_0\\rangle\\}\\bigr)^k.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{SConf}_{M,k}\\coloneqq Q\\times(\\Sigma\\cup\\{\\$\\})^*\\times\n\\bigl((\\Gamma\\setminus\\{Z_0\\})^*\\cdot\\{\\langle Z_0\\rangle\\}\\bigr)^k.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n(q,u,\\mathbf s)\\leadsto_{M,k}(p,v,\\mathbf t)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists a\\in\\Sigma\\cup\\{\\$,\\varepsilon\\}\\;\\exists\\mathbf X\\in\\Gamma^k\\;\n\\exists\\boldsymbol\\beta,\\boldsymbol\\gamma\\in(\\Gamma^*)^k\\;[\n((q,a,\\mathbf X),(p,\\boldsymbol\\beta))\\in\\delta\\land u=\\operatorname{WordLabel}_{\\Sigma\\cup\\{\\$\\}}(a)v\n\\land\\forall j\\in\\{1,\\ldots,k\\}\\;(s_j=\\langle X_j\\rangle\\gamma_j\\land t_j=\\beta_j\\gamma_j)].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n(q,u,\\mathbf s)\\leadsto_{M,k}(p,v,\\mathbf t)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists a\\in\\Sigma\\cup\\{\\$,\\varepsilon\\}\\;\\exists\\mathbf X\\in\\Gamma^k\\;\n\\exists\\boldsymbol\\beta,\\boldsymbol\\gamma\\in(\\Gamma^*)^k\\;[\n((q,a,\\mathbf X),(p,\\boldsymbol\\beta))\\in\\delta\\land u=\\operatorname{WordLabel}_{\\Sigma\\cup\\{\\$\\}}(a)v\n\\land\\forall j\\in\\{1,\\ldots,k\\}\\;(s_j=\\langle X_j\\rangle\\gamma_j\\land t_j=\\beta_j\\gamma_j)].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nL_{\\mathsf{stk},k}(M)\\coloneqq\\{w\\in\\Sigma^*:\\exists C\\in\\operatorname{SConf}_{M,k}\\;[\n((q_0,w\\langle\\$\\rangle,\\langle\\langle Z_0\\rangle:1\\le j\\le k\\rangle),C)\n\\in\\operatorname{RTC}_{\\operatorname{SConf}_{M,k}}(\\{(D,E):D,E\\in\\operatorname{SConf}_{M,k},\\ D\\leadsto_{M,k}E\\})\n\\land\\pi_1(C)\\in F\\land\\pi_2(C)=\\varepsilon]\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nL_{\\mathsf{stk},k}(M)\\coloneqq\\{w\\in\\Sigma^*:\\exists C\\in\\operatorname{SConf}_{M,k}\\;[\n((q_0,w\\langle\\$\\rangle,\\langle\\langle Z_0\\rangle:1\\le j\\le k\\rangle),C)\n\\in\\operatorname{RTC}_{\\operatorname{SConf}_{M,k}}(\\{(D,E):D,E\\in\\operatorname{SConf}_{M,k},\\ D\\leadsto_{M,k}E\\})\n\\land\\pi_1(C)\\in F\\land\\pi_2(C)=\\varepsilon]\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>教材本节只给非形式描述，本条补出有限元组与运行关系。底符保持和终态无后继是明确的规范化选择；输入为带结束标记的词，接受检查必须读完它。ε 动作与读字符动作互斥，才能保持确定性；不能把结束标记偷偷加给通常不带结束标记的 DPDA 定义。</p>\n<p>当转移表为空时，同一个八元组可以满足不同的栈数参数；因此配置空间不能只以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> 索引。显式的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span> 消除了该歧义，未改变任何固定栈数下的运行或接受条件。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-finite-words-and-languages","status":"resolved","id":"0a6da8c909717780","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-partial-value-conventions","status":"resolved","id":"773cae915e5165f3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-partial-value-conventions]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-finite-path-closure","status":"resolved","id":"25902d0bd75ea963","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-finite-path-closure]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"k\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}","display":false},{"tex":"M","display":false},{"tex":"M","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{StackMachine}_{\\Sigma,k}(M)","display":false},{"tex":"M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,Z_0,F,\\$)","display":false},{"tex":"\\$\\notin\\Sigma\\cup\\{\\varepsilon\\}","display":false},{"tex":"Z_0","display":false},{"tex":"(q,u,\\mathbf s),(p,v,\\mathbf t)\\in\\operatorname{SConf}_{M,k}","display":false},{"tex":"j\\in\\{1,\\ldots,k\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{WordLabel}","display":false},{"tex":"k","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{StackMachine}_{\\Sigma,k}(M)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists Q,\\Gamma,q_0,Z_0,F,\\$\\;\\exists\\delta:(Q\\setminus F)\\times(\\Sigma\\cup\\{\\$,\\varepsilon\\})\\times\\Gamma^k\n\\rightharpoonup Q\\times(\\Gamma^*)^k\\;\\bigl[&\nM=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,Z_0,F,\\$)\\land\\$\\notin\\Sigma\\cup\\{\\varepsilon\\}\\land0<|Q|<\\aleph_0\\land\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Gamma)\\land q_0\\in Q\\land Z_0\\in\\Gamma\\land F\\subseteq Q\\\\\n&\\land\\forall q,\\mathbf X\\;((q,\\varepsilon,\\mathbf X)\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\delta)\\Longrightarrow\n\\forall a\\in\\Sigma\\cup\\{\\$\\}\\;(q,a,\\mathbf X)\\notin\\operatorname{dom}(\\delta))\\\\\n&\\land\\forall((q,a,\\mathbf X),(p,\\boldsymbol\\beta))\\in\\delta\\;\\forall j\\in\\{1,\\ldots,k\\}\\;\n[(X_j=Z_0\\Longrightarrow\\beta_j\\in(\\Gamma\\setminus\\{Z_0\\})^*\\cdot\\{\\langle Z_0\\rangle\\})\n\\land(X_j\\ne Z_0\\Longrightarrow\\beta_j\\in(\\Gamma\\setminus\\{Z_0\\})^*)]\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{SConf}_{M,k}\\coloneqq Q\\times(\\Sigma\\cup\\{\\$\\})^*\\times\n\\bigl((\\Gamma\\setminus\\{Z_0\\})^*\\cdot\\{\\langle Z_0\\rangle\\}\\bigr)^k.","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n(q,u,\\mathbf s)\\leadsto_{M,k}(p,v,\\mathbf t)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists a\\in\\Sigma\\cup\\{\\$,\\varepsilon\\}\\;\\exists\\mathbf X\\in\\Gamma^k\\;\n\\exists\\boldsymbol\\beta,\\boldsymbol\\gamma\\in(\\Gamma^*)^k\\;[\n((q,a,\\mathbf X),(p,\\boldsymbol\\beta))\\in\\delta\\land u=\\operatorname{WordLabel}_{\\Sigma\\cup\\{\\$\\}}(a)v\n\\land\\forall j\\in\\{1,\\ldots,k\\}\\;(s_j=\\langle X_j\\rangle\\gamma_j\\land t_j=\\beta_j\\gamma_j)].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nL_{\\mathsf{stk},k}(M)\\coloneqq\\{w\\in\\Sigma^*:\\exists C\\in\\operatorname{SConf}_{M,k}\\;[\n((q_0,w\\langle\\$\\rangle,\\langle\\langle Z_0\\rangle:1\\le j\\le k\\rangle),C)\n\\in\\operatorname{RTC}_{\\operatorname{SConf}_{M,k}}(\\{(D,E):D,E\\in\\operatorname{SConf}_{M,k},\\ D\\leadsto_{M,k}E\\})\n\\land\\pi_1(C)\\in F\\land\\pi_2(C)=\\varepsilon]\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"M","display":false},{"tex":"k","display":false}],"bytes":4039,"backlinks":[{"id":"34c08ba68aabce9a","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[73-df-endmarked-multistack-machine]]"},{"id":"6af52783a9bce985","anchor":"ref-164","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[73-df-endmarked-multistack-machine|带输入结束标记的确定性多栈机]] （本轮新建）"},{"id":"bff9c8d0e9f70335","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"5fb4984fbec82c2e","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["0a6da8c909717780","773cae915e5165f3","25902d0bd75ea963"]}